1
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:02,583
What?

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:04,458
Lord Severin?

3
00:00:04,916 --> 00:00:06,000
What’s wrong, Lord Campbell?

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,083
Do you know him?

5
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:09,166
Of course I know him.

6
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:11,083
I became Lord of the
Wastelands

7
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,958
because Lord Severin guided me.

8
00:00:14,041 --> 00:00:15,250
What?!

9
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:15,916
Lord Campbell,

10
00:00:15,916 --> 00:00:18,250
are you saying he helped
 you become Lord of 
the Wastelands?

11
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:21,583
I must have misheard.

12
00:00:21,583 --> 00:00:24,250
I rule the
 entire Wastelands.
I would

13
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:25,916
never joke about something like this.

14
00:00:26,458 --> 00:00:28,250
But he was disowned by House Carter 

15
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:30,125
and became a worthless miner.

16
00:00:31,708 --> 00:00:33,625
How could he possibly help you?

17
00:00:33,625 --> 00:00:36,000
Lady Livia, you are wrong.

18
00:00:37,166 --> 00:00:40,958
Lord Severin is a
man of heaven-defying power.

19
00:00:40,958 --> 00:00:44,125
I don’t know his
true identity, but years ago,

20
00:00:44,125 --> 00:00:46,041
with just two sentences,

21
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:48,291
he pulled my family
back from the brink of

22
00:00:48,291 --> 00:00:49,416
destruction and made me

23
00:00:49,416 --> 00:00:51,208
Lord of the entire Wastelands.

24
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Lord Severin is a
true god of Golantis.

25
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
So when you helped
 my family…

26
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,625
it was on his orders?

27
00:01:00,791 --> 00:01:01,541
Yes.

28
00:01:01,541 --> 00:01:03,625
Not only that. 
Every time you faced a

29
00:01:03,625 --> 00:01:06,333
crisis these past
three years and survived,

30
00:01:06,333 --> 00:01:08,291
it was because Lord Severin

31
00:01:08,291 --> 00:01:10,208
secretly ordered help for you.

32
00:01:13,625 --> 00:01:15,458
This can't be.

33
00:01:18,541 --> 00:01:20,583
This is impossible.
